DESCRIPTION:Bloomington knows a thing or two about trophies now. For the h
 ome game this Saturday\, the Eskenazi Museum of Art is handing the hardwar
 e to you. Pick up a trophy at the welcome table and head into the gallerie
 s\, where you are the judge.  Which artwork looks the oldest? Which one to
 ok the most time to make? Which one tells the best story? Or invent an awa
 rd of your own. Hold your trophy up (18 inches back from the art)\, snap a
  photo of your winner. Receive a free art museum sticker for participating
 .  The challenge runs across three floors. Self-guided\, family friendly\,
  and drop-in\, so stay for ten minutes or an hour on your way to Memorial 
 Stadium.
