DESCRIPTION:Parade returns to Kirkwood with a route starting on Washington
  Street and ending at Sample Gates!\n We might be biased\, but Homecoming 
 weekend in Bloomington is one of the best times of the year—it’s a cha
 nce to reconnect with friends and relive your favorite IU traditions. The 
 IUAA hosts events throughout the weekend\, including the parade on Friday 
 evening and a tailgate on Saturday. Join us Oct. 30-31 for IU Homecoming 2
 026.\n On Saturday\, we’ll kick off game day bright and early with the H
 oosier Huddle\, an exclusive tailgate for IUAA supporters and their guests
 . Be on the lookout for more details and your exclusive invitation to this
  special IUAA event. Check our website for more info!
