SUMMARY:The Exorcist (1973)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T210000
UID:260920XZY9CilDpkezIt1Uotq33w
DESCRIPTION:One of the most iconic horror movies ever made\, this tale of 
 an exorcism is based loosely on actual events. A HALLOWEEN MUST SEE!\n\nWh
 en young Regan (Linda Blair) starts acting odd — levitating\, speaking i
 n tongues — her worried mother (Ellen Burstyn) seeks medical help\, only
  to hit a dead end.\n\nA local priest (Jason Miller)\, however\, thinks th
 e girl may be seized by the devil.\n\nThe priest makes a request to perfor
 m an exorcism\, and the church sends in an expert (Max von Sydow) to help 
 with the difficult job.\n\nLENGTH: 2hr 2mins FORMAT: DCP RATED: R
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/the-exorcist-1973-october-31-2026/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
