 4cc/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1385x1268+0+0/resize/254x233!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb4%2Fb3%2Fd01c06be4be6ba
 d39a5d1a8817b6%2F2026-chili-fest-chapel-schoolhouse.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Vandalia Community Preservation Association\nVand
 alia Community Preservation Association Annual Chili Fest fundraiser\, wit
 h soup\, dessert\, and bottled water served in the one-room schoolhouse (1
 :00 - 4:30 pm)\, and live entertainment by Lloyd Wood and his well-known\,
  highly talented and acclaimed musician friends in the historic chapel (be
 ginning at 2:30 pm). Admission is $12 for adults ($5 for children age 10 a
 nd under) and covers the entire event.\nAll funds raised are dedicated to 
 the preservation and maintenance of the historic Vandalia chapel and schoo
 lhouse (listed in the National Register of Historic Places).
LOCATION:Historic village of Vandalia 6 miles west of Spencer\, IN (Owen C
 ounty)\, 5471 Vandalia Road (Vandalia\, Indiana)\, Spencer\, Indiana 47460
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/vandalia-community-preser
 vation-association-annual-chili-fest-09-10-2026-13-21-55
