SUMMARY:Don't Bother to Knock | Matinee Classics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261101T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261101T173000
UID:c2967a74746b30d3c02f109845868117@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Hoping to reconcile with his girlfriend Lyn (Anne Bancroft in 
 her screen debut)\, pilot Jed Towers (Richard Widmark) arrives at the hote
 l where she works only to be rebuffed. Meanwhile\, a fragile young woman n
 amed Nell Forbes (Marilyn Monroe) is trying to get a fresh start in life a
 fter being in a sanitarium by babysitting for one of the hotel’s familie
 s. Striking up a flirtation with Jed\, Nell slowly becomes more dangerous 
 as her grasp on reality begins to loosen\, revealing a haunting\, surprisi
 ngly tender portrait of trauma unlike anything else Monroe put on celluloi
 d. [76 min\; film noir\; English]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/dont-bother-to-knock-matinee-cl
 assics/59989/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
