DESCRIPTION:First Sunday Prose in November will feature writers Shana Ritt
 er and Angela Herrmann. Come early to sign up for open mic and order some 
 refreshments\, pick up a Halloween card\, and check out the art and sale i
 tems at Juniper Art Gallery! \nShana Ritter writes poetry and prose and pi
 eces in between. Her chapbook\, Stairs of Separation\, was published by Fi
 nishing Line Press. In the Time of Leaving\, a novel of exile and resilien
 ce\, is set in late 15th century Spain. Shana has been awarded the Indiana
  Individual Artist Grant on multiple occasions.
