 n fiber and textiles. Or you can try learning something new\; we welcome a
 ll skill levels! Either way\, you're sure to have a good time.</p><p>  Thi
 s group meets on the 1st and 3rd Tuesday of each month from 34:30 p.m.\, e
 xcluding holidays and museum closures. The group will meet in the Roehm Fa
 mily Art-making Studio\, located inside the Simpson Center for Education o
 n the 2nd floor of the Eskenazi Museum of Art.</p>
