 veaways. IU Students can also use a special campus shuttle to get around t
 o all participating venues! For the full list of locations\, activities\, 
 and giveaway details\, please visit <a href="https://artsandhumanities.ind
 iana.edu/council-programs/first-thursdays/index.html">go.iu.edu/first-thur
 sdays</a>.</p>
