X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>First Thursdays showcase the diversity of arts and 
 humanities at IU Bloomington and offer a welcoming environment for student
 s\, faculty\, staff\, and community members to explore new creative outlet
 s. Each event is a unique opportunity to experience the wonderful work of 
 artists\, performers\, and scholars from all across campus and around town
 .</p>
