SUMMARY:Art as a Representation of Sustainability: Preserving Culture\, En
 vironment\, and Economic Vitality
DTSTART:20261105T220000Z
DTEND:20261105T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261006T093133Z
UID:20261105T220000Z-2441689@events.iu.edu
