X-SOURCE-ID:visit_bloomington
SUMMARY:Story: Sajik Kim
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T160000
UID:991a16c37b615ac7a29ebf5943245a97@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Artist Talk: Friday\, September 11\, 12-1 pm\, Shreve Auditori
 um-Global and International Studies Building (355 N. Eagleson Avenue)\nOpe
 ning reception: Friday\, September 11\, 6-8 pm\, Grunwald Gallery\nArtist 
 Performance: Friday\, September 11\, 7 pm\, Grunwald Gallery \nRegular Gal
 lery Hours: Tuesday - Saturday 12 - 4 PM
