RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T173000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261021T182311Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join our friend Manuel from Partisan Gardens and try some S
 alvadoran atole de elote! </p><p></p><p>Atole is a traditional\, hot\, mas
 a-based beverage from Central America. Atole can be made with different fl
 avors\, such as vanilla\, cinnamon\, and pineapple.</p><p></p><p>This casu
 al event will feature an atole demonstration and guided conversations on u
 rban gardening. </p><p></p><p>Feel free to come\, enjoy a warm beverage\, 
 and leave when you like! </p><p></p><p>Register in the pantry or at <a hre
 f="http://mhcfoodpantry.org/education" target="_blank">mhcfoodpantry.org/e
 ducation</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T182312Z
LOCATION:1100 W Allen St\, Bloomington\, IN 47403\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Mother Hubbard's Calendar
END:VEVENT
