UID:1a18a2939a8d9e2d390e420eae96a5db@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars for Friday\, November 6 from 6–8 PM and 
 join us for an evening of good food\, friendly competition\, games\, and f
 ellowship at St. Mark’s!\nOur St. Mark’s Chili Cookoff is back! Dust o
 ff your favorite recipe and bring a pot to share—whether your specialty 
 is a classic beef chili\, something spicy\, vegetarian\, white chicken chi
 li\, or a recipe all your own. Not a chili chef? Come hungry! Everyone is 
 invited to sample the entries\, enjoy a bowl of a favorite\, and help us c
 rown this year’s Chili Cookoff champions.\nThere will be plenty happenin
 g while the chili is simmering! Game Night will be happening alongside the
  cookoff\, so pick a game from our game library or pull up a chair and joi
 n one already underway.\nUnited Women in Faith will also be hosting an all
 -ages cheese ball making class! Come learn how to make UWF’s cheese ball
 s\, get the recipe to take home\, and join in the fun. Cheese balls will a
 lso be available for purchase or can be ordered ahead\, with proceeds supp
 orting the Lucille Raines Residence.\nCome for the chili\, learn to make a
  cheese ball\, play a game—or enjoy a little bit of everything! Sign up 
 to make chili via the sign up genius listed here.
GEO:39.1666113;-86.49870709999999
LOCATION:St. Mark's United Methodist Church\, 100 North State Rd 46\, Bloo
 mington\, IN 47408
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/st-marks-chili-cookoff-cheeseba
 ll-making-class-game-night/60068/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
