SUMMARY:Combined Desires: The Short Film of Justin Clifford Rhody & Abigai
 l Smith
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T203000
DTSTAMP:20261031T043533Z
UID:7o1uf9vjoo1lcbvhbr7gu5a9hv@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T190000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261013T213224Z
DESCRIPTION:COMBINED DESIRES:\nThe Short Films of Justin Clifford Rhody & 
 Abigail Smith\n\nThis sixty-five minute program by New Mexico-based\, self
 -taught visiting filmmakers\, Justin Clifford Rhody and Abigail Smith\, sh
 owcases works created both collaboratively and independently over the last
  five years. This specially curated selection includes cosmic-time period 
 pieces\, seizure-inducing deconstructions\, meditative abstractions\, horr
 or/morality tales\, and experimental sonic affinities created using 35mm\,
  16mm and Super-8mm film\, as well as MiniDV tape. Recommended to enthusia
 sts of unflinching amateurism and the materiality of film\, and to viewers
  who find narrative to be overrated. The artists will be in attendance to 
 offer a brief introduction before the screening\, pace uncomfortably outsi
 de during the screening\, and to satiate the audience’s burning inquirie
 s during an informal Q&A afterward.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T220848Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Redbud Books
END:VEVENT
