 /168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,768\,768/32328_Michael-Berryhill-portrait-in-
 studio-CROPPED-WEB.rev.1788367315.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Michael Berryhill
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>The McKinney Visiting Artist series presents a talk
  by Michael Berryhill\, who creates enigmatic paintings that arise from dr
 awings and allude to subjects\, often human or animal figures.</p>
