DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261107T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261107T203000
UID:43fb61862edde3d789b5cd920c92bc94@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:No No Nooky T.V. (1987): No No Nooky T.V. confronts the femini
 st controversy around sexuality with electronic language\, pixels\, and in
 terface. Even the monitor is eroticized in this film/video hybrid that poi
 nts fun at romance\, sexuality\, and love in our post-industrial age. [12 
 min\; experimental\; English]\nNitrate Kisses (1992): Barbara Hammer’s d
 ocumentary Nitrate Kisses confronts the historical erasure of queer sexual
 ity through the frank embrace of sex as an act that is both liberating and
  political. [67 min\; English]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/no-no-nooky-tv-nitrate-kisses-u
 nderground-film-series/59996/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
