DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Chamber Singers open their 2026/2027 season wi
 th Bach n' Roll\, a concert built to offer a little something for everyone
 . The program includes Bach with a swing\, music by the Beatles\, and an a
 rrangement of Queen's Bohemian Rhapsody.\n\nBCS is a mixed voice\, volunte
 er-based\, not-for-profit chorus\, now in its 57th season.\n\nTickets: $20
  general admission. $10 at the door with student ID. Tickets are available
  at the door or online through the Chamber Singers website.\n\nLivestream:
  Free with registration on the Chamber Singers website.\n\nVenue: Unitaria
 n Universalist Church\, 2120 N Fee Lane\, Bloomington.\n\nMore information
 : https://www.chambersingers.info/concerts-all/bach-and-roll\n\nListed on 
 BloomingtonOnline.com\, your community guide to Bloomington and Monroe Cou
 nty. Submit your event at https://bloomingtononline.com/submit-an-event/
