SUMMARY:Stand Up for Habitat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261107T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261107T210000
UID:37c387b8119b7a61588cb742d921100f@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Habitat for Humanity is looking forward to partnering with And
 rew Lambert again this year for the Stand Up for Habitat Comedy Show at th
 e Buskirk-Chumley Theater. This professional comedy showcase brings nation
 ally touring talent to Bloomington for an unforgettable night of laughter.
  Every dollar in ticket sales supports Habitat for Humanity of Monroe Coun
 ty to empower local families to build strength\, stability\, and self-reli
 ance through affordable homeownership.\nThis year’s lineup features NYC 
 based headliner Elle Orlando. Elle has appeared at NYC clubs such as The C
 omedy Cellar\, New York Comedy Club\, The Stand\, and more. The evening wi
 ll once again be hosted and produced by Andrew Lambert\, who keeps the ene
 rgy high and the audience rolling.\nCome for the comedy\, stay for the cau
 se\, and leave knowing your night of laughter helped families in our commu
 nity achieve the safety and stability of a place to call home.\nThis is a 
 live comedy show that may contain adult themes and language\; guests must 
 be 18+ to attend. The content of the performances is solely that of the co
 medians and does not necessarily reflect the views or values of Habitat fo
 r Humanity of Monroe County.
GEO:39.1662844;-86.5328085
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E. Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47408
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/stand-up-for-habitat/59812/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
