SUMMARY:Get certified in Wilderness First Aid (WFA)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261108T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261108T170000
UID:7e5c4f4031417ecbf171dd2d9c3a9ad9@ipm.org
DESCRIPTION:Get certified in Wilderness First Aid (WFA) \nGain the skills 
 needed to respond to medical emergencies out in the wild. This two-day\, 1
 6-hour course features hands-on learning opportunities\, and participants 
 will earn a two-year WFA certification from SOLO\, a leader in wilderness 
 education. Attendees can also add CPR modules\, and/or re-certify for thei
 r SOLO Wilderness First Responder (WFR). Tuition includes course materials
  and lunch both days. Courses start at $275.\nTickets: https://bradwoods-f
 ireform.eas.iu.edu/online/form/index/WFA
LOCATION:Bradford Woods\, 5040 State Road 67 N\, Martinsville\, Indiana 46
 151
