CREATED:20261027T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Spiritual Formation Opportunity </p><p dir="ltr"
 > </p><p dir="ltr">Would you like a chance to really deepen your spiritua
 l life and your relationship with God? Do you want to pray more regularly
 \, but could use some structure and accountability? If so\, you might be i
 nterested in participating in a program of  guided personal prayer and sm
 all group spiritual direction meetings\, grounded in the Spiritual Exercis
 es of St. Ignatius of Loyola (a rich\, centuries-old program of spiritual 
 development). If you are at all curious about this\, please come to an inf
 ormational meeting in the library on Sunday\, Nov 8\, between the 9:00 and
  11:30 services\, to learn more. If you have any questions\, email Sheila 
 Taylor (taylorsh9@gmail.com).</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T183001Z
LOCATION:Library
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Trinity Episcopal Church
END:VEVENT
