 d the artwork we'll use as inspiration for our project! When you're ready
 \, head back to the studio for our hands-on art-making activity that every
 one will love.</p><p>  This program takes place every Second Sunday of the
  month\, excluding holidays and museum closures. Each month features new a
 rtworks and materials\, so there's always something fresh to explore and c
 reate!</p><p>  All children must be chaperoned.</p>
