X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Browncounty": "https://browncounty.com/events/operation-250-flags-for-veterans/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:Operation 250: Flags for Veterans
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261109T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261109T151500
DTSTAMP:20260930T180513Z
UID:MEC-6dd8169e6d0651e3b16ce96fa5259ee4@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261109T140000
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/Flags-For-Veterans-1.png
CATEGORIES:Educational,Family Friendly,Free,Holiday,Special Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260930
DESCRIPTION:Join the Brown County Community Foundation in honoring our vet
 erans during America’s 250th Anniversary Year.\nThis free\, open to the 
 public event will include a historical presentation of three Revolutionary
  War veterans who are buried in Brown County\, unique resources for vetera
 ns in our community\, and moments of recognition and honor for those who h
 ave served our county. Refreshments will be provided.\n\nPlease take a mom
 ent to RSVP here: https://docs.google.com/…/1FAIpQLSeRZJ0ClJBp9Q…/view
 form\n\n\nAll donations made to the Foundation before November 1st can be 
 in honor of a veteran\, living or deceased. The donor’s name and the nam
 e of the honored veteran will be included in the November 11th publication
  of the Brown County Democrat. Additionally\, for every $100 donated\, a U
 nited States 250th Anniversary Betsy Ross handheld flag will be given to a
  veteran. You can pick up the flag(s) at the BCCF office to present to a v
 eteran yourself\, or it will be given to a veteran at the Flags for Vetera
 ns event.\nJoin the Brown County Community Foundation in honoring these br
 ave men and women while investing in the future of Brown County by going t
 o browncountygives.org. ( http://browncountygives.org )\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260930
LOCATION:South Van Buren Street\, Nashville\, Indiana
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Community Foundation":MAILTO:
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/operation-250-flags-for-veterans/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
