  South Asian Culture</p><p>  Learning Outcomes:<br />  Basic principles of
  Rangoli design and symmetry<br />  Explore common Rangoli-inspired patter
 ns\, shapes\, and motifs<br />  Practice creating repeated patterns using 
 dots\, lines\, and geometric forms</p>
