X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2429686
X-LIVEWHALE-RSVP:1
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Participants will be introduced to Rangoli\, a 
 traditional Indian decorative art form\, and learn how make patterns\, sym
 metry\, dots\, lines\, and geometric shapes with different powder color.\n
 </p>
