 paratus</strong>\, 2019. Print portfolios on canvas\, 62 1/8 x 67 1/4 x 3 
 1/8 in.
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Come look closely at the <em><a href="https://a
 rtmuseum.indiana.edu/exhibitions/2026-09-12-samuel-levi-jones-archaeology-
 of-knowledge.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Samuel Levi Jones: An Ar
 chaeology of Knowledge</a></em> exhibition with curator Leila Reichert and
  special guest I. India Thusi.\n</p>
