SUMMARY:Aeronautics to Toast: A Broad Patent Practice with Mark A. Davis
DTSTART:20261110T170000Z
DTEND:20261110T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260928T150203Z
UID:20261110T170000Z-2433057@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261110T170000Z
CATEGORIES:Student-run
DESCRIPTION:CIPR and the IPA are pleased to welcome  Mark A. Davis\, Partn
 er at McGarry Bair PC!  Drawing on a career that spans everything from coo
 ling gas turbine aircraft engines to the mechanics of toasting bread\, Mr.
  Davis will share practical career advice\, key industry knowledge\, and a
 necdotes from his broad legal practice.  He will highlight the diverse and
  unconventional technologies he has patented over the years\, alongside a 
 brief tour of history's most famously oddball patents.  This session is hi
 ghly recommended for students interested in intellectual property\, patent
  prosecution\, engineering and technology law\, or anyone curious about ho
 w adaptable a legal career can be.  RSVP by November 9th at noon.&#160\;
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T225653Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2433057-practitioner-in-residence-m
 ark-a-davis
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  CIPR and the IPA are pleased to welcome<
 br />  Mark A. Davis\, Partner at McGarry Bair PC!</p><p>  Drawing on a ca
 reer that spans everything from cooling gas turbine aircraft engines to th
 e mechanics of toasting bread\, Mr. Davis will share practical career advi
 ce\, key industry knowledge\, and anecdotes from his broad legal practice.
 <br />  He will highlight the diverse and unconventional technologies he h
 as patented over the years\, alongside a brief tour of history's most famo
 usly oddball patents.</p><p>  This session is highly recommended for stude
 nts interested in intellectual property\, patent prosecution\, engineering
  and technology law\, or anyone curious about how adaptable a legal career
  can be.</p><p>  RSVP by November 9th at noon.&#160\;</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Melissa Berry<br />\n  Intellectual Proper
 ty Association (IPA)\n</p>
