DESCRIPTION:Join us for Ctrl + Alt + Relax\, an SZA-themed self-care works
 hop in collaboration with Culture of Care! Take a break from the stress o
 f the semester and unwind with us while listening to SZA and enjoying thr
 ee interactive stations: mini puzzles\, coloring\, and DIY picture frame 
 decorating. We'll also have self-care goodie bags filled with face masks\
 , stress-relief items\, eye masks\, candy\, and more!\nWhether you're fee
 ling overwhelmed\, need a study break\, or just want to spend time with f
 riends\, come relax\, get creative\, and recharge with us! You deserve a 
 break\, so let us help you Ctrl + Alt + Relax!\n\nHosted by: Culture of C
 are\, Office for Sexual Violence Prevention and Victim Advocacy\n\nAdditi
 onal Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12
 933820
