 rall average moving speed of 12 - 15 mph.  Distances vary from 20 to a li
 ttle over 30 miles.  Early season rides will be at the lower end of the d
 istance scale.  During colder weather the ride departs at 1:00pm.  </sp
 an><br><br>Non-members should sign up for a <a href="https://secure.getme
 registered.com/get_information.php?event_id=136627" target="_blank">free t
 rial membership</a>\, good for up to three rides\, and which includes elec
 tronically signing a liability waiver\, prior to participation.<br><br><b
