  Museum of Art for a guided exploration of art through queer perspectives
 . Together\, we’ll consider how gender\, sexuality\, identity\, relations
 hips\, and self-expression can shape the ways we understand art and its h
 istories. Whether you’re an art enthusiast or simply curious\, come explo
 re\, ask questions\, and discover new ways of looking at familiar and per
 haps unfamiliar works. Pease make sure to RSVP to the event if you are in
 terested. \n\nHosted by: LGBTQ+ Culture Center\, Sidney and Lois Eskenazi
  Museum of Art\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvol
 ved.indiana.edu/event/12900576
