 he ways we understand art and its histories. Whether you're an art enthusi
 ast or simply curious\, come explore\, ask questions\, and discover new wa
 ys of looking at familiar and perhaps unfamiliar works. Pease make sure to
  RSVP to the event if you are interested.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
