DESCRIPTION:An annual collaboration between the Student Composers Associat
 ion in the IU Jacobs School of Music and the Eskenazi School's Grunwald Ga
 llery. The performance will feature premieres by composers Sam Thompson\, 
 Anchi Wang-Hall\, Devon Lee\, Archer Lohman\, and Darren Binkowski.  "STOR
 Y" is a creation myth drawn from the lived experience of the artist\, who 
 was born and raised in Japan as a third-generation Korean national. Infuse
 d with theatrical elements and embodied performance\, "STORY" explores how
  one might establish a sense of self and live with rootedness amid the con
 stant flux of identity.
