SUMMARY:Raise the Red Lantern | The Long Revolution
DESCRIPTION:With her family thrown into despair by the death of her fathe
 r\, teenager Songlian becomes the third concubine of wealthy Master Chen.
  Soon\, she discovers that behind her palatial luxury of life\, she and h
 er fellow concubines are pitted against each other in a struggle for his 
 affections. [125 min\; drama\; Mandarin with English subtitles]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  With her family thrown into despair by 
 the death of her father\, teenager Songlian becomes the third concubine o
 f wealthy Master Chen. Soon\, she discovers that behind her palatial luxu
 ry of life\, she and her fellow concubines are pitted against each other 
 in a struggle for his affections. [125 min\; drama\; Mandarin with Englis
 h subtitles]</p>
