UID:809ece0e88ec77f70edc3baa371e2994@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you always wanted to learn how to cross stitch? This is y
 our chance to give it a try!\nCome join us for a cozy little stitching ses
 sion and make your very own Pumpkin Kitty. This adorable seasonal project 
 comes with everything you need to create a sweet piece of hanging art\, pe
 rfect for bringing a little handmade charm to your home for the cozy seaso
 n.\nYou’ll learn the basics from start to finish\, including how to get 
 your project started\, make your cross stitches\, follow the pattern\, and
  finish your piece so it’s ready to hang and enjoy.\nNo experience is ne
 eded. Just come ready to slow down\, learn something new\, and spend a lit
 tle time making something cute.\nAll materials are included. Class size: 1
 –5 participants\nCome stitch a little\, chat a little\, and make your ow
 n Pumpkin Kitty!\nAll workshops are non-refundable.
GEO:39.1671921;-86.5334276
LOCATION:Gather :handmade shoppe & co.:\, 116 N. Walnut Street\, Bloomingt
 on\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/pumpkin-kitty-cross-stitch/5990
 4/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
