DTSTART:20261114T000000Z
DTEND:20261114T010000Z
LOCATION:IU CINEMA
GEO:39.168613;-86.517376
SUMMARY:Sorcerer w/Q&A | Re:Made
DESCRIPTION:Four men on the run from the law in South America jump at the
  chance to solve their problems by accepting a job that pays $10\,000 and
  will grant them legal citizenship. The catch? They have to stay alive wh
 ile ferrying a shipment of highly unstable nitroglycerin across 200 miles
  of bad roads\, unstable bridges\, and unpredictable attacks from local g
 angs. [121 min\; thriller\, suspense\; English and Spanish with English s
 ubtitles]The screening will be followed by a discussion of stunt work in 
 film between Leraldo Anzaldua and Patrick Kelly.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Four men on the run from the law in Sou
 th America jump at the chance to solve their problems by accepting a job 
 that pays $10\,000 and will grant them legal citizenship. The catch? They
  have to stay alive while ferrying a shipment of highly unstable nitrogly
 cerin across 200 miles of bad roads\, unstable bridges\, and unpredictabl
 e attacks from local gangs. [121 min\; thriller\, suspense\; English and 
 Spanish with English subtitles]</p><p><i><strong>The screening will be fo
 llowed by a discussion of stunt work in film between Leraldo Anzaldua and
  Patrick Kelly.</strong></i></p>
