SUMMARY:SIX
DESCRIPTION:From Tudor Queens to Pop Icons\, the SIX wives of Henry VIII 
 take the microphone to remix five hundred years of historical heartbreak 
 into a Euphoric Celebration of 21st century girl power! This new original
  musical is the global sensation that everyone is losing their head over!
   &#160\;The New York Times says SIX "TOTALLY RULES!" (Critic's Pick) and
  The Washington Post hails SIX as "Exactly the kind of energizing\, inspi
 rational illumination this town aches for!"  &#160\;  The SIX: LIVE ON OP
 ENING NIGHT Broadway album debuted at Number 1 on the Billboard cast albu
 m charts and surpassed one billion streams worldwide!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  From Tudor Queens to Pop Icons\, the <i
 >SIX</i> wives of Henry VIII take the microphone to remix five hundred ye
 ars of historical heartbreak into a Euphoric Celebration of 21st century 
 girl power! This new original musical is the global sensation that everyo
 ne is losing their head over!</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><i>The New York Times
 </i> says <i>SIX </i>"TOTALLY RULES!" (Critic's Pick) and <i>The Washingt
 on Post</i> hails <i>SIX</i> as "Exactly the kind of energizing\, inspira
 tional illumination this town aches for!"</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  The <i>
 SIX</i>: LIVE ON OPENING NIGHT Broadway album debuted at Number 1 on the 
 Billboard cast album charts and surpassed one billion streams worldwide!<
 /p>
