CATEGORIES:Spirituality
CATEGORIES:Tradition & Community
CATEGORIES:Spiritual Wellness
DESCRIPTION:\nfxCampus invites you to join us for our weekly worship servi
 ce at fxchurch on Sundays at 10:10AM. We meet at the historic Banneker Co
 mmunity Center in Bloomington. \n\n\nDirections - Parking is available on
  the street\, Girls Inc.\, and Rev. Ernest D. Butler ParkNeed a ride to c
 hurch? Let us know and we will pick you up!\nWatch our service live onlin
 e on Youtube\n\n\n\nHosted by: Foot of the Cross Campus Ministry\n\nOnlin
