CATEGORIES:Lectures, talks, seminars, and conferences
DESCRIPTION:Today's 60-minute Virtual Information Session will offer guida
 nce regarding your application portfolio. Bring your questions to the conv
 ersation.  The J. Irwin Miller Master of Architecture program is a three-y
 ear in-residence program\, with a two-year advanced placement track possib
 le for students who hold a B.Arch from a NAAB-accredited institution or re
 gional equivalent. With our twin studios approach\, students take visual a
 rt course alongside architectural studios to develop their style of archit
 ectural design. The three-year program welcome applicants from a variety o
 f educational and career backgrounds.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261012T184816Z
LOCATION:Virtual
URL:https://events.iu.edu/soaadiub/event/2447908-miller-architecture-progr
 am-virtual-info-session-app
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="p1">  Today's 60-minute Virtual Inf
 ormation Session will offer guidance regarding your application portfolio.
  Bring your questions to the conversation.</p><p class="p1">  The J. Irwin
  Miller Master of Architecture program is a three-year in-residence progra
 m\, with a two-year advanced placement track possible for students who hol
 d a B.Arch from a NAAB-accredited institution or regional equivalent. With
  our twin studios approach\, students take visual art course alongside arc
 hitectural studios to develop their style of architectural design. The thr
 ee-year program welcome applicants from a variety of educational and caree
 r backgrounds.</p>
