  precepts</u></u></a> throughout our lives. We carry out this ceremony on
  the Monday evening closest to the 15th of each month (except Feb &amp\; A
 ug)\, beginning at 7 pm.<br><br>​All are welcome\, in-person and <a hre
 f="https://www.sanshinji.org/virtual-practice.html" target="_blank"><u><u>
 virtually</u></u></a>\, whether or not you've formally received precepts.
  </td></tr></tbody></table><br><strong><em>If attending in person\, pleas
 e show up by 6:50 pm\, to allow enough time for offering incense and purif
 ying rakusu or okesa (if you have one) before the ceremony.</em></strong><
