X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Limestone Post": "https://buskirkchumley.org/events/iu-latin-jazz-ensemble-november-16-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:limestone_post
SUMMARY:IU Latin Jazz Ensemble
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T210000
UID:260914D64wcl-J00C4RWmz08L_GA
DESCRIPTION:Join the Indiana University Latin Jazz Ensemble in honoring th
 e musical legacies of John Coltrane and Miles Davis on their centennial an
 niversary.\n\nWith special guest artists trumpeter Ingrid Jensen and saxop
 honist Imanuel Wilkins\, the ensemble will be performing their classic son
 gs with an Afro-Caribbean twist.\n\nIt will be a fun-filled\, high energy 
 evening as we celebrate the music of these 20th century icons.\n\nThe Indi
 ana University Latin Jazz Ensemble is a 25-piece ensemble led by trombonis
 t Wayne Wallace and rhythm section coach Andy Miller. Bring your dancing s
 hoes!\n\nThis event is FREE. No tickets are needed.
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/iu-latin-jazz-ensemble-november-16-2
 026/
