X-SOURCE-URLS:{"WFIU Community Calendar": "https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/iu-latin-jazz-ensemble-12-09-2026-12-40-50"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wfiu_community_calendar
SUMMARY:IU Latin Jazz Ensemble
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T210000
UID:0b47e4b486ac8a42cf13c100b9f57b15@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/9146
 257/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3456x2304+0+0/resize/254x169!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9b%2Ff4%2F3668e7b0453ab2
 3aa7fa9f0f99be%2Flatin-jazz.JPG
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Jazz Department\, Jacobs School of Music\nJoin th
 e Indiana University Latin Jazz Ensemble in honoring the musical legacies 
 of John Coltrane and Miles Davis on their centennial anniversary.\n With s
 pecial guest artists trumpeter Ingrid Jensen and saxophonist Imanuel Wilki
 ns\, the ensemble will be performing their classic songs with an Afro-Cari
 bbean twist.\n It will be a fun-filled\, high energy evening as we celebra
 te the music of these 20th century icons.\n The Indiana University Latin J
 azz Ensemble is a 25-piece ensemble led by trombonist Wayne Wallace and rh
 ythm section coach Andy Miller. Bring your dancing shoes!\n This event is 
 FREE. No tickets are needed.\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/i
 u-latin-jazz-ensemble-november-16-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/iu-latin-jazz-ensemble-12
 -09-2026-12-40-50
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
