DESCRIPTION:Need help using or setting up a new device? Trying to access t
 he Library's eBooks or eAudiobooks? Learning how to use Zoom? Drop in for 
 individual help and learn new digital skills.  Age 18 and up Downtown Libr
 ary Meeting Room 2C This program is first come\, first served. Note: This 
 program cannot do major device troubleshooting or repairs. If your device 
 is broken\, please contact the manufacturer’s help line\, the store you 
 purchased the device from\, or a technology repair shop for assistance.
