X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:Brown County Art Guild 2026 Annual Raffle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T180000
DTSTAMP:20260417T142538Z
UID:MEC-d14387be71d9f4739f36dd3051dfb343@browncounty.com__20261119
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 04/f461e264-81fc-43ba-96f8-1ed7cc92b101.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Happening,Tournaments &amp\; Games
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260417
DESCRIPTION:Take a chance to win ‘Painters Point’\, a beautiful origin
 al oil painting generously donated by Guild Artist\, Allen Hutton. He stri
 ves to render the fleeting patterns of light and shadow with the simple 
 purpose of preserving the reality of a landscape at a particular moment in
  time and season. Allen has achieved numerous awards and his art can be
  found in both private and corporate collections across the county.   
 \nTickets:  1 for $30\, 2 for $50\, or 5 for $100   \nYour generosity 
 helps the Guild to preserve its historic collection\, promote its award-wi
 nning artist members\, and offer workshops and programs throughout the yea
 r!  \nThe drawing of the winning raffle ticket will be held at 3pm on Sa
 turday\, November 21\, 2026\, at the Guild.  \nThe winner need not be pr
 esent for the drawing.  \nPurchase options: \nIn person at the Guild\, 
 call 812-988-6185 or purchase raffle tickets at:  \nhttps://browncountya
 rtguild.org/product/brown-county-art-guild-annual-raffle/ \n————
 ————————————————————————
 ————————————- \nBrown County Art Guild – PO B
 ox 324 – 48 S. Van Buren St. Nashville\, Indiana 47448 – Ph# 812-9
 88-6185 \n– A not-for-profit organization located in the heart of d
 owntown Nashville\, Indiana. On display throughout its galleries is a priz
 ed collection of historic paintings as well as current works for sale from
  regional award-winning member artists.  Throughout the year\, the Guil
 d offers artist demonstrations\, workshops\, and special exhibits.   
 \nGuild hours: March-December 2026\, Monday – Saturday\, 11 – 5 and Su
 nday\, 12 – 4 or by appointment. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, South Van Buren Street\, Nashville\, IN
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Art Guild":MAILTO:admin@bcartguild.org
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/brown-county-art-guild-2026-annual-raff
 le/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
