 oric achievements in the Big Ten and the national stage. The items feature
 d in the exhibit are from the IU Athletics Sports Memorabilia Collection a
 nd feature photos and videos provided by IU Athletics and Indiana Universi
 ty Archives.                </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><strong>Da
