 meet-up on November 19th at the Monroe County Public Library Downtown bran
 ch! Come hang out with fellow stationery fans and bring your favorite item
 s to share or work on. Junk journals\, letter writing\, planners\, etc!&#1
 60\;</p><p>  We will be meeting in room 1C from 5-6:45 pm and light refres
 hments will be provided. Also\, don't forget to bring stationery items to 
 swap and share with others!&#160\;</p>
