DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261120T220000
UID:75e185ac93f6bc22399abcfcfc1bcf91@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join us for a night of music\, art\, and co
 mmunity. Live music performances by Time Well Spent\, The U-Station Agents
 \, and more. Flash Tattoos by Jason Profant\, Julian/bblackhoundd\, and Ha
 ley/Yelah Tattoos. Essay and poetry readings by members of Women Writing f
 or (a) Change. Food from Erika Yochum and Pili’s Party Truck. Cash Bar. 
 Live Karaoke. Overall Merriment. All proceeds will go towards opening Bloo
 mington’s 1st birth center\, as well as other Tandem services including 
 our Hoosier Diaper Program\, support groups\, Free Room\, Doula Equity Pro
 gram\, Period Equity Program\, and more. All Ages Event. Tickets can be pu
 rchased at: www.givebutter.com/tandemfest
