BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_d1087e97d4ace1c1ca2dd6336d417bea870ddac277be6d1711cbc0235aa85228
SUMMARY:Bloomington Short List: 10 Acts\, 10 Minutes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T200000
DTSTAMP:20261031T043417Z
UID:6lmf7lrji7rcuvp6ljhkovhtt4@google.com__20261121
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261022T204508Z
DESCRIPTION:A free\, all-ages cabaret night with ten 10-minute acts by loc
 al performers: music\, comedy\, dance\, storytelling\, magic\, juggling\, 
 puppetry\, poetry and more. The setting is informal\, friendly and non-com
 petitive\, with a quick pace that keeps things moving.\n\nWhen: Third Satu
 rday of each month\, 6 to 8 p.m.\nAdmission: Free\nAges: All ages welcome
 \nVenue: Bloomington Elks Lodge\, 400 N. Walnut St.\, downtown Bloomington
 \n\nThe organizers are also looking for performers of all kinds to fill fu
 ture lineups.\n\nListed by BloomingtonOnline.com\, Bloomington's community
  events calendar.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T204512Z
LOCATION:Bloomington Elks Lodge\, 400 N. Walnut St.\, Bloomington\, IN
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonOnline Events
END:VEVENT
