X-SOURCE-ID:mcplin_feeds
X-SOURCE:Monroe County Public Library
UID:17383309
DTSTART:20261121T180000Z
DTEND:20261121T190000Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:"It's a Hard Knock Life" Musical Theater Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Participants will sing and dance as they rehearse a song f
 rom Constellation's upcoming musical "Annie\," culminating in a short\
 , informal performance to share with family and friends. Ages 812.
LOCATION:Downtown Library - Auditorium
GEO:39.1669872;-86.5303618
DTSTAMP:20261031T043528Z
ORGANIZER;CN=Monroe County Public Library;LANGUAGE=en:mailto:noreply@m
 cpl.info
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visit Bloomington": "https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/bloomington-short-list/60095/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visit_bloomington
SUMMARY:Bloomington Short List
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T203000
UID:fbaf7b95748434b7a704b5f890772b68@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Designed to offer as much varied and quality entertainment as 
 possible\, The Short List provides an intimate and fast-paced presentation
  of ten\, 10-minute acts featuring singing\, comedy\, poetry\, dancing -- 
 and a whole lot more. Performers of all ages will showcase Bloomington’s
  vast array of established and aspiring talent in an informal cabaret sett
 ing to run on the third Saturday of each month at Elk’s Lodge #446\, 200
  N. Walnut St. from 6 to 8:30 p.m.
GEO:39.1676966;-86.5333575
LOCATION:Bloomington Elks Lodge #446\, 200 N. Walnut St.\, Bloomington\, I
 N 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/bloomington-short-list/60095/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visit Bloomington": "https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/open-studio-at-gather/59953/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visit_bloomington
SUMMARY:Open Studio - at Gather
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T200000
UID:fcc74148f09c8f30a8b9b19ae998c28d@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Make an evening of it.\nGather your favorite women\, bring you
 r date\, or come with someone you love and settle into an evening of creat
 ivity and connection at Gather.\nCome after dinner\, choose a project from
  our Creative Studio\, and we’ll get you started. Pour a glass of wine\,
  put on some music\, and spend the rest of the evening making something be
 autiful together.\nNo reservations. No workshop schedule. Just an open stu
 dio\, a good drink\, and time to linger.\nOpen Studio Date Night\nEvery Fr
 iday + Saturday\nGather is open until 8pm
GEO:39.1671921;-86.5334276
LOCATION:Gather :handmade shoppe & co.:\, 116 N. Walnut Street\, Bloomingt
 on\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/open-studio-at-gather/59953/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
