X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/11/width/168/height
 /168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,768\,768/32784_260911_CAMi_Promotional_Image_
 05-detail-WEB.rev.1790774789.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Daniel Luis Martinez\, from The Blueprint series
 \, cyanotype print and drawing\, 2026 (detail).
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>An exhibition by Miller Architecture Program Direct
 or and Associate Professor Daniel Luis Martinez at the Contemporary Art Mu
