UID:3a295ec41baef19f4da9a2bc61030023@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Rock in the holidays with the BSO’s much-loved Celebrate the
  Season!\n Are you ready to celebrate the season with the Bloomington Symp
 hony Orchestra?\n Popcorn? Check.\nComfy chair? Check.\nLights turned down
  low? Check.\n The feeling of quiet anticipation you get when they play mu
 sic from your favorite holiday films? Check!\n Music from the Movies is th
 e theme of this year’s festive holiday celebration.\nChoose from the 5pm
  or 8pm show\, before or after enjoying Bloomington’s Canopy of Lights.
GEO:39.1662908;-86.5327948
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E. Kirkwood Avenue\, Bloomington\, 
 IN 47408
