X-SOURCE-ID:localist_mccormicks_creek
SUMMARY:Opt Outside Hike 2026\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T110000
UID:537ebef4c6ed7a4a01745c4e66cd0829@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, November 27 th Opt-Outside Day 11 am: Fire Tower Hike
 - (Hike) Join Naturalist Jessie in front of the Canyon Inn to begin our 1.
 4-mile hike through the woods to learn about Civilian Conservation Corp hi
 story and how it helped provide money to families during the Great Depress
 ion. On this hike you will have a choice to summit to the top of the Fire 
 Tower. &nbsp\;
