DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nAre you ready to celebra
 te the season with the Bloomington Symphony Orchestra?\n Popcorn? Check.\n
  Comfy chair? Check.\n Lights turned down low? Check.\n The feeling of qui
 et anticipation you get when they play music from your favorite holiday fi
 lms? Check!\n Music from the Movies is the theme of this year’s festive 
 holiday celebration.\n Choose from the 5pm or 8pm show\, before or after e
 njoying Bloomington’s Canopy of Lights.\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley
 .org/events/celebrate-the-season-november-27-2026/
