SUMMARY:Miracle on 34th Street
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T210000
UID:f014b5a855618fbfbc93a3f20e47ac6f@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/3d7256a0-c2b4-4381-9914-8d45539b8bad.png/3d7256a0-c2b
 4-4381-9914-8d45539b8bad.png
DESCRIPTION:🎄✨ MIRACLE ON 34TH STREET ✨🎄Friday\, November 27 a
 t 7:00 PMLet the Christmas Magic Begin! ❤️It’s time to put up the tr
 ee\, grab a cup of cocoa\, and let a little Christmas magic into your hear
 t!Join us at the MET for the beloved holiday classic Miracle on 34th Stre
 et\, the perfect movie to kick off our Christmas Movie Season! 🎅🎬W
 hen a kindhearted man claiming to be the real Santa Claus arrives in New Y
 ork City\, he brings a little wonder\, hope\, and Christmas spirit to ever
 yone around him. But when his identity is questioned\, a young girl and he
 r mother discover that sometimes the greatest Christmas miracles happen wh
 en you simply believe.❤️ Heartwarming\, funny\, nostalgic\, and full
  of Christmas magic\, Miracle on 34th Street is the perfect way to start
  the holiday season.So bring the family\, bring your friends\, and come g
 et in the Christmas spirit with us! 🎄📅 Friday\, November 27🕖 7
 :00 PM🎟️ Tickets just $5!💵 Cash or card accepted!The Christmas M
 ovie Season starts here at the MET!✨ Believe in the magic. Believe in t
 he wonder. Believe in Christmas. ✨Movie: Miracle on 34th Street (1947)S
