X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2405055
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/261/width/168/heigh
 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,800\,800/32331_Dec2026Rodriguez-headshot.rev
 .1788370251.png
