DESCRIPTION:Activities include the Cookie Walk and Gourmet Galaxy bake sal
 es\, the White Elephant sale (our church garage sale)\, the Book (and CD/v
 inyl) sale\, and the Art Fair in our Meeting Room.\n The Gourmet Galaxy of
 fers cakes\, breads\, jellies\, etc. Cookie Walk has specialty cookies. Ou
 r Social Justice Task Forces offer handmade hats and scarves. Used househo
 ld items are available at the White Elephant Sale\, along with high value 
 antiques and collectibles in the Golden Elephant Emporium. Bazaar Books wi
 ll offer thousands of titles.\n Local Artists & Artisans booths.
