 1/src_region/0,0,3200,2400/33271_IMG_2247_3.rev.1793109680.jpg
CATEGORIES:Health and wellness,Lectures, talks, seminars, and conferences
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an afternoon of discussion surrounding digi
 tal media\, online identity\, and mental health alongside our ongoing Happ
 iness 2.0 Project. An introduction will be led by Eskenazi Museum's Wilma 
 E. Kelley Director Mindy Besaw\, highlighting the importance of integratin
 g arts and sciences\, followed by a further presentation from the Happines
 s 2.0 Team. Anyone interested is welcome to attend.  The Happiness 2.0 Pro
 ject is a collaboration of the Eskenazi Museum of Art\, The Media School\,
  and IU Counseling and Psychological Services. More information about this
  initiative can be found on the Happiness 2.0 web page. (https://mediascho
 ol.indiana.edu/research/happiness-2.html)
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T150752Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
URL:https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2464836-happyapero
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Please join us for an afternoon of discu
 ssion surrounding digital media\, online identity\, and mental health alon
 gside our ongoing Happiness 2.0 Project. An introduction will be led by Es
 kenazi Museum's Wilma E. Kelley Director Mindy Besaw\, highlighting the im
 portance of integrating arts and sciences\, followed by a further presenta
 tion from the Happiness 2.0 Team. Anyone interested is welcome to attend.<
 /p><p>  The Happiness 2.0 Project is a collaboration of the Eskenazi Museu
 m of Art\, The Media School\, and IU Counseling and Psychological Services
 . More information about this initiative can be found on the <a href="http
 s://mediaschool.indiana.edu/research/happiness-2.html">Happiness 2.0 web p
 age.</a></p>
