 t/168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,3200\,2131/32936_WylieChristmasOpenHouse_202
 31206_005.rev.1791390953.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Join Wylie House Museum for its festive <em>Gar
 lands &amp\; Greenery Open House</em> on Saturday\, December 5\, from 10 a
 .m. to 4 p.m. This free\, drop-in event invites you to experience the muse
 um adorned for the holiday season.\n</p>
