 ce
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h3>  Before the dance performance</h3><p>  T
 our the exhibition The Photographic Reflex: The Lee Marks and John C. DePr
 ez Jr. Collection with the curator at 11:30 before the IU Contemporary Dan
 ce performance inspired by this exhibition\, at noon.&#160\;</p><p>  Befor
 e the dance performance\, join Ben Levy\, Glaubinger Curator of Works on P
 aper\, for a guided short tour at 11:30 am to learn more about some of the
  photographs that inspired the dance performance. <a href="https://events.
 iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2395982-curator-led-tour">Details.</a></p><h3>  Abo
 ut the dance performance</h3><p>  IU Contemporary Dance students have sele
 cted artworks in the exhibition as inspiration for an interpretative dance
  performance at noon. They will perform original choreography\, inspired b
 y the exhibition.</p><p><a href="https://artmuseum.indiana.edu/exhibitions
 /2026-08-29-photographic-reflex-marks-deprez.html">Read more about this ex
 hibition.</a></p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Ben Gardner\, Mellon and Moravec Universit
 y Experiences Manager<br />\n  benagard@iu.edu\n</p>
