SUMMARY:Another Round
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T210000
UID:dded8a877941c0c67595b25faf601d30@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/30d9aae4-4cfc-4172-93e6-f859f068403d.jpg/30d9aae4-4cf
 c-4172-93e6-f859f068403d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of incredible vocal talent\, sharp harmo
 nies\, and high-energy entertainment as Another Round takes the stage at 
 the Martinsville Entertainment Theatre on Saturday\, December 12!Known fo
 r their electrifying a cappella arrangements\, seamless harmonies\, and in
 fectious stage presence\, Indiana University’s premier all-male a cappel
 la group\, Another Round\, brings a performance packed with fan favorites
 \, modern hits\, timeless classics\, and seasonal cheer. Whether you’re 
 coming for the breathtaking vocal arrangements\, the hilarious stage antic
 s\, or a festive night out with family and friends\, Another Round guarant
 ees a show that will have you singing along from the very first note.This 
 show will be Interactive\, fun\, and packed with personality—perfect for
  all ages!Don't wait until the last second—grab your tickets early\, bri
 ng your friends\, and join us for an unforgettable night of music and fun 
 right in the heart of downtown Martinsville!Date: Saturday\, December 12
 \, 2026Time: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)Location: Martinsville Enter
 tainment Theatre\, 36 E Morgan Street\, Martinsville\, INDoors open one ho
 ur before shows for ticket and concession sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFORMATION
 When selecting your seats for non-general admission shows\, please be awar
 e that balcony access is via stairs only. Wheelchair-accessible seating is
  available for guests who use wheelchairs. There is no seat in wheelchair-
 accessible seating.CONCESSIONS ARE AVAILABLEPlease do not bring any outsid
 e food\, beverages or drink containers. Concessions open one hour before t
 he start of every show.WHAT IS YOUR REFUND POLICY?All sales are final. We 
 do not offer exchanges for other movies or performances. Tickets can be fo
 rwarded to friends and family.WILL THE MET CANCEL SHOWS FOR BAD WEATHER?In
  the interest of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effort will
  be made to reschedule instead of cancel.HOW CAN I PAY FOR MY TICKETS AND 
 CONCESSIONS?The MET now accepts cash\, debit or credit cards for your conv
 enience. Box Office opens one hour before shows for in-person sales. 
GEO:39.428027;-86.4280804
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre (The MET)\, 36 East Morgan Str
 eet\, Martinsville\, 46151
