 oung girl whose unbreakable optimism leads her on an unforgettable journey
  from a New York City orphanage to a place she can finally call home. Feat
 uring one of Broadway’s most memorable scores\, including “It’s the 
 Hard-Knock Life\,” “Easy Street\,” “N.Y.C.” and the endlessly-up
 lifting “Tomorrow\,” Annie is a delightful theatrical experience for t
 he entire family. See Constellation’s website for more information\, inc
 luding a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at htt
