 10/2-300x240-10.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Live Music
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261027
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating 26 years of turning concerts into full-blown rock 
 spectacles\, Hairball continues to bring the ultimate 80s Rock & Roll trib
 ute to fans across the nation. With heart-pounding accuracy\, they recreat
 e the iconic sound and style of legends like Van Halen\, KISS\, Mötley Cr
 üe\, and Queen\, transforming the stage into an ever-changing tribute to 
 rock history. Packed with pyrotechnics\, lights\, and surprises\, every Ha
 irball show is a larger-than-life experience. For two and a half decades\,
  they’ve ignited crowds with their passion for Rock & Roll\, proving the
 y’re still at the top of their game!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027
LOCATION:200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville\, IN 47448
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Music Center":MAILTO:boxoffice@browncountymusic
 center.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/hairball/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
