 isits\, and career immersion in the nation's capital.Program Highlights &a
 mp\; Key Dates:Program Dates: Summer term runs approximately May 27 – Ju
 ly 17.Application Deadline: Summer applications are due February 15.Career
  &amp\; Academic Immersion: Engage in policy seminars\, network with senio
 r practitioners\, and receive personalized coaching on resumes\, outreach
 \, and optional internship searches.Q&amp\;A Session: Get direct answers f
 rom program staff about academic credit\, housing at Crimson Row\, and app
 lication requirements.How to Join:  Click the Zoom link at 12:00 PM on Wed
 nesday\, January 20 to join the live virtual session. Meeting URL: https:/
 /iu.zoom.us/j/7227932379
