X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Knobstone Hiking Trail Association Of Indiana Meetup": "https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of-indiana-meetup/events/plpwxtykcdbbc/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_knobstone_hiking_trail_association_of_indiana_meetup
X-SOURCE:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association
UID:event_plpwxtykcdbbc@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T043513Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270220T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270220T153000
SUMMARY:2nd Weekend Work Day Trail Building
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\nWould yo
 u to spend a day in some beautiful woods with a delightful group of people
  building a connecting section of Indiana’s premier long distance hiking
  trail? Come join us as we continue work on the Tecumseh Trail extension p
 ortion of the KHT in MMSF. We will be building the new trail including cli
 pping green briar.\nPlease bring a lunch and water. We will have large han
 d tools\, but please bring any small tools you have such as clippers or a 
 pruning saw. And a backpack is handy to carry everything in. Instructions 
 will be provided for those who need them. We finish about 3:30.\nMeet at t
 he Hatfield Ridge Road parking lot. The gate is open. Go to the big sign o
 n Rosenbaum/Catholic Cemetry Rd.\nJoin us on our website at http://www.kno
 bstonehikingtrail.org/\, on Facebook at [www.facebook.com/groups/225558611
 7953484](http://www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484)\, and Substack [
 https://khta.substack.com/](https://khta.substack.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of
 -indiana-meetup/events/plpwxtykcdbbc/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260613T130909Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260613T130909Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Bloomspinweave": "https://bloomspinweave.org/event/introduction-to-two-color-brioche-knitting-with-megan-bube"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bloomspinweave
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Spinners & Weavers Guild
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270220T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270220T160000
DTSTAMP:20261022T134757Z
CREATED:20251122T172002Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T134757Z
UID:5513-1803117600-1803139200@bloomspinweave.org
SUMMARY:Introduction to Two Color Brioche Knitting with Megan Bube
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, February 20th\, 10 AM – 4:00 PM \nCurious about learning brioche knitting? Come join us for this one-day introductory class! Participants will learn two-color brioche knitting in both flat and in-the-round\, including a few common increase and decrease stitches found in brioche patterns. Students are expected to know intermediate/advanced knitting techniques such as knitting in the round\, slipped stitches\, and how to use a cable needle. \nStudents should bring the following: Two ~10-gram balls of DK or worsted weight yarn in 2 contrasting colors (recommended to use a light and a dark or a variegated and a solid color)\, size US4 or US5 circular needles or DPNs\, and a cable needle. \nFor more information and to register\, click here. \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/introduction-to-two-color-brioche-knitting-with-megan-bube
LOCATION:Fiber Arts Center\, College Mall\, Bloomington\, 3038 East Third Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47401\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bloomspinweave.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/25-Brioche-Megan.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Guild":MAILTO:educationbswg@gmail.com, newsletterbswg@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
